{"seq":2,"slug":"wms-inventory-to-ledger-data-mapping","title":"WMS 库存数据到账册底账的映射：料号、计量单位与损耗","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-warehouse-ledger-integration/wms-customs-integration/wms-inventory-to-ledger-data-mapping","wordCount":2723,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"wms-库存数据到账册底账的映射-料号-计量单位与损耗\">WMS 库存数据到账册底账的映射：料号、计量单位与损耗</h1><p>保税仓最容易被低估的一段工程，不是海关报文怎么发，而是<strong>发之前那一步</strong>：WMS 里某个货位上的 1,200 件料号，凭什么变成账册底账上的 240 千克？这两个数之间隔着一条三段式的映射管道——料号归并、计量单位换算、损耗扣减。管道里任何一段的口径与海关备案口径不一致，账册的进出存就对不平；而对不平是核查的第一靶点。更麻烦的是，这条管道不是一次性的 ETL，它必须在每一次入仓、出仓、盘点的实时路径上按当时的映射版本复算，历史核注才可审计。</p>\n<p>本文只谈这条映射管道本身：它由什么组成、每一段的失效模式是什么、以及对账时差异该往哪里归因。账册的四层结构与归并关系表的 DDL，见同章 <a href=\"./\">本章导览</a> 与同 hub 的 <a href=\"../eledger-annotation-list/e-ledger-hierarchy-and-item-filing\">电子账册结构模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-映射管道的三段式结构\">核心概念：映射管道的三段式结构</h2><p>把 WMS 的一次库存变动送到账册底账，标准做法是串行经过三个纯函数环节，而不是在报文组装时才临时拼装：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  W[&quot;WMS 库存事件&lt;br/&gt;料号 + 数量(内部单位) + 货位 + 批次&quot;] --&gt; N[&quot;① 料号归并&lt;br/&gt;π: SKU → 账册项号&quot;]&#10;  N --&gt; U[&quot;② 单位换算&lt;br/&gt;q_legal = q_internal × r&quot;]&#10;  U --&gt; L[&quot;③ 损耗与状态扣减&lt;br/&gt;净可用量 = 数量 − 损耗 − 冻结&quot;]&#10;  L --&gt; D[&quot;账册底账增量&lt;br/&gt;项号 + 法定数量 + 方向&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; M[&quot;核注清单表体&lt;br/&gt;CEB 报文 / 单一窗口&quot;]&#10;  M --&gt; B[&quot;底账记账&lt;br/&gt;进口/库存/出口/结转&quot;]\">graph TD\n  W[\"WMS 库存事件&lt;br/&gt;料号 + 数量(内部单位) + 货位 + 批次\"] --&gt; N[\"① 料号归并&lt;br/&gt;π: SKU → 账册项号\"]\n  N --&gt; U[\"② 单位换算&lt;br/&gt;q_legal = q_internal × r\"]\n  U --&gt; L[\"③ 损耗与状态扣减&lt;br/&gt;净可用量 = 数量 − 损耗 − 冻结\"]\n  L --&gt; D[\"账册底账增量&lt;br/&gt;项号 + 法定数量 + 方向\"]\n  D --&gt; M[\"核注清单表体&lt;br/&gt;CEB 报文 / 单一窗口\"]\n  M --&gt; B[\"底账记账&lt;br/&gt;进口/库存/出口/结转\"]</pre><p>三段之所以要分开成独立的可测试函数，是因为<strong>它们的失效模式完全不同</strong>：① 错了表现为「项号不存在」或「归错税号」；② 错了表现为「数量成比例偏大或偏小」；③ 错了表现为「账册多于实物」或反之。混在一个大函数里，报错时你分不清是归类问题、精度问题还是损耗口径问题。每一段都应当返回<strong>带原因的拒绝</strong>，而不是抛一个通用异常——对账报告要按段归因。</p>\n<p>三段共享同一个前提：<strong>所有输入必须锚定在一个映射版本上</strong>。映射不是常量，它随备案变更、商品上新、单位调整而变。因此每次库存事件在落账时，除数量外还必须固化一个 <code>mapping_version</code> 外键；没有它，三个月后的差异分析无法复现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"料号归并-从内部-sku-到账册项号\">料号归并：从内部 SKU 到账册项号</h2><p>第一段把企业内部料号映射到账册的备案商品项号。记企业侧料号集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.075em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>，账册项号集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{I}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0738em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span>，归并关系是一个满射：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"script\">S</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">I</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"script\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>⨆</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">I</mi></mrow></munder><msup><mi>π</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi:\\ \\mathcal{S} \\to \\mathcal{I},\\qquad \\mathcal{S} = \\bigsqcup_{i \\in \\mathcal{I}} \\pi^{-1}(i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.075em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0738em;\">I</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.075em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0738em;\">I</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">⨆</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.075em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 被划分成若干互不相交的组（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⨆</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bigsqcup</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">⨆</span></span></span></span></span> 表示不相交并），每组对应一个项号。这个数学结构决定了三条工程约束：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束</th>\n<th>违反后果</th>\n<th>落地做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单值性：一个料号只能属一个项号</td>\n<td>同一批货被两条项号同时记账，库存重复虚增</td>\n<td>归并表对 <code>sku_code</code> 在有效期交集上建唯一约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完备性：每个可出入库料号都须有项号</td>\n<td>出仓时归不出项号，货物卡在卡口</td>\n<td>入仓前的准入校验，无映射即拒收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稳定性：已发生记账的映射不得就地改写</td>\n<td>历史核注无法复算，核查时无法举证</td>\n<td>关闭旧行 <code>valid_to</code>、新增版本行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三条最常被运营挑战。业务上「料号归并错了，改一下」是高频诉求，但正确应对永远是<strong>关旧行、开新行</strong>，而不是 UPDATE。因为核注清单一旦被海关接收并记账，它就是一条已发生的法律事实；它引用的项号与数量关系被冻结在当时那一版映射上。改历史映射行等于篡改证据，这也是核查最忌讳的。</p>\n<p>归并的粒度本身就是设计决策。归并越粗，项号越少、维护越省，但<strong>单位换算与规范申报要素的异质性被压进同一个项号</strong>，误差放大；归并越细，项号越多、越精确，但备案变更成本上升。判断基准是：只有当两个料号的 <strong>HS 编码到十位一致、法定计量单位一致、规范申报要素可直接套用同一套模板</strong> 时，才应归并到同一项号。任何一项不满足而强行归并，都会在其中一个环节埋下差异。</p>\n<h2 id=\"计量单位-内部数量到法定数量的换算\">计量单位：内部数量到法定数量的换算</h2><p>第二段是差异最隐蔽的来源。账册一律以<strong>法定计量单位</strong>记账，而法定计量单位由商品所属 HS 编码在海关统计商品目录中确定（海关总署《中华人民共和国海关进出口货物报关单填制规范》要求报关单同时申报法定第一/第二计量单位与成交计量单位）。企业侧料号却常以内部单位（卷、箱、片、托）或成交单位记录。两者之间的桥是换算系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>法定</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>π</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q^{\\text{法定}}_{i} = \\sum_{s \\in \\pi^{-1}(i)} q_s \\cdot r_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1383em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">法定</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.566em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7463em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只记「法定单位与内部单位同量纲」是不够的。真实的坑有三层：</p>\n<p><strong>第一，双重换算链。</strong> 内部单位往往不是直接到法定单位。例如「片」→「卷」→「平方米」→「千克」，中间每一跳都有自己的精度与舍入规则。规范做法是只保留<strong>一跳</strong>：内部单位直接到法定单位，中间单位仅用于展示。多跳链会把每一跳的舍入误差累乘，在数万条料号上放大成可观缺口。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，精度与舍入方向。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 必须定一个明确的小数位（工程上常用六位 <code>numeric(18,6)</code>）与舍入方向。海关按项号汇总后通常保留有限小数位，因此累加顺序会影响结果：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>round</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>s</mi></munder><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>s</mi></munder><mtext>round</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{round}\\Big(\\sum_s q_s r_s\\Big) \\neq \\sum_s \\text{round}(q_s r_s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>正确做法是<strong>先在浮点/十进制域内精确累加到项号级，最后一次性舍入到账册口径</strong>，而不是逐条料号先舍入再相加。这个顺序差异在料号数上千时足以造成账册与实物对不上。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，必要性校验。</strong> 换算系数只有在量纲真的不同时才应为非 1。若某条料号的单位与法定单位同量纲而系数又不为 1，几乎必然是数据录入错误。系统应把「同量纲单位 + 非 1 系数」标为需要人工确认的异常，而不是静默接受。换算系数与归并关系一样，必须随料号一同版本化——它是账册数量口径的一部分，不是可随时调整的运营参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"损耗-从合理损耗到账册核减\">损耗：从合理损耗到账册核减</h2><p>第三段处理「数量为什么会少于入库时的数量」。这里要先区分三种性质完全不同的减少，混为一谈是最常见的设计错误：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>减少类型</th>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>账册处置</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>合理损耗（自然挥发、破碎、计量差）</td>\n<td>真实发生、可解释</td>\n<td>按备案损耗率核减，报核时说明</td>\n<td>参照《加工贸易单耗管理办法》（海关总署令第155号）净耗/工艺损耗思路</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灭失与毁损（火灾、水浸、丢失）</td>\n<td>真实发生、非常态</td>\n<td>单独申报、可能触发补税</td>\n<td>保税仓库监管办法（海关总署令第105号）对灭失货物的处置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冻结与在途（质检锁定、跨区调拨未达）</td>\n<td>未减少、状态变化</td>\n<td>不核减，但也不计入可用</td>\n<td>底账分户，见同章 <a href=\"./\">本章导览</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三者最关键的差别是：<strong>只有前两类才改变账册的进出口平衡</strong>，第三类不改变总量、只改变底账归属。把在途量当成损耗核减，会让账册凭空少一块，核销时补不回来。</p>\n<p>对合理损耗，工程上要显式定义扣减是否可加。若同一条料件同时经受多道环节损耗，合理的模型是可加：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mtext>总</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msup><mi>q</mi><mtext>净</mtext></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mtext>入</mtext></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mtext>总</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_{\\text{总}} = \\sum_k \\eta_k, \\qquad q^{\\text{净}} = q^{\\text{入}} (1 - \\eta_{\\text{总}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">总</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">净</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1413em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">入</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">总</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>但这只对<strong>独立</strong>的损耗环节成立。若两个环节的损耗作用在同一个基量上（例如先是计量误差、再是在同一批上重复计损），简单相加会重复扣减。因此系统必须为每一类损耗记录<strong>计损基量</strong>：是作用于入库总量、还是作用于上一环节的输出。这个字段缺失时，损耗率一多就会系统性多扣。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对账机制与差异归因\">对账机制与差异归因</h2><p>管道的价值只有在定期对账时才真正兑现。正确姿势是<strong>分层对账</strong>，而不是拿总数硬比——总数相等可能掩盖两个方向相反、相互抵消的错误：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;第一层:料号级&lt;br/&gt;WMS 库存 vs 归并累计&quot;] --&gt; A1{&quot;差异?&quot;}&#10;  A1 --&gt;|有| A2[&quot;归因:归并漏映射 / 换算精度&quot;]&#10;  A1 --&gt;|无| B[&quot;第二层:项号级&lt;br/&gt;∑ 料号法定量 vs 底账&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; B1{&quot;差异?&quot;}&#10;  B1 --&gt;|有| B2[&quot;归因:换算系数版本不一致 / 舍入顺序&quot;]&#10;  B1 --&gt;|无| C[&quot;第三层:底账级&lt;br/&gt;期末 = 期初 + 进 − 出 − 损耗&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; C1{&quot;差异?&quot;}&#10;  C1 --&gt;|有| C2[&quot;归因:损耗口径 / 在途未成对写入&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"第一层:料号级&lt;br/&gt;WMS 库存 vs 归并累计\"] --&gt; A1{\"差异?\"}\n  A1 --&gt;|有| A2[\"归因:归并漏映射 / 换算精度\"]\n  A1 --&gt;|无| B[\"第二层:项号级&lt;br/&gt;∑ 料号法定量 vs 底账\"]\n  B --&gt; B1{\"差异?\"}\n  B1 --&gt;|有| B2[\"归因:换算系数版本不一致 / 舍入顺序\"]\n  B1 --&gt;|无| C[\"第三层:底账级&lt;br/&gt;期末 = 期初 + 进 − 出 − 损耗\"]\n  C --&gt; C1{\"差异?\"}\n  C1 --&gt;|有| C2[\"归因:损耗口径 / 在途未成对写入\"]</pre><p>三层各对应一段管道，所以差异能直接落到「哪一段」。实践中最多的两类差异是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>料号级无差异、项号级有差异</strong>：换算系数在两个系统里取了不同精度，或累加后再舍入 vs 先舍入再累加。修的是第二段。</li>\n<li><strong>项号级无差异、底账级有差异</strong>：损耗扣减基量不一致，或在途量被误当损耗核减。修的是第三段。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对账报告不应只给「差多少」，而要给「差在哪一段、由哪一版映射引入」。这正是前文坚持固化 <code>mapping_version</code> 的回报：差异可复算、可举证、可在核对报告中逐条说明，而不是在核查现场临场解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>映射是一条三段式管道</strong>（料号归并 → 单位换算 → 损耗扣减），每段失效模式不同，必须拆成独立的、返回带原因拒绝的函数。</li>\n<li><strong>每次落账必须固化映射版本</strong>；已记账的映射只能关旧行、开新行，绝不就地改写，否则历史核注无法复算。</li>\n<li><strong>归并的判据是三项同时一致</strong>：HS 十位、法定计量单位、规范申报要素；任一项不满足就不应归并到同一项号。</li>\n<li><strong>单位换算只保留一跳</strong>（内部 → 法定），先在精确域累加到项号级、最后一次性舍入，避免逐条舍入的累乘误差。</li>\n<li><strong>损耗必须分类</strong>：合理损耗、灭失毁损、在途冻结三者性质不同，只有前两类改变账册平衡；在途量误当损耗核减会造成补不回来的缺口。</li>\n<li><strong>对账要分层做</strong>：料号级 → 项号级 → 底账级，差异才能直接归因到管道的某一段。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>映射管道的下游——底账增量如何驱动核注清单与核放单、差错如何重放——见同章 <a href=\"./\">本章导览</a> 中本章其余两篇文档。上游的备案口径来源见 <a href=\"../eledger-annotation-list/e-ledger-hierarchy-and-item-filing\">电子账册结构模型</a>；周期性盘点的余料与差异处置见 <a href=\"../bonded-stocktake-writeoff/\">保税仓盘点与核销</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"WMS 库存数据到账册底账的映射：料号、计量单位与损耗","id":"wms-库存数据到账册底账的映射-料号-计量单位与损耗"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：映射管道的三段式结构","id":"核心概念-映射管道的三段式结构"},{"level":2,"text":"料号归并：从内部 SKU 到账册项号","id":"料号归并-从内部-sku-到账册项号"},{"level":2,"text":"计量单位：内部数量到法定数量的换算","id":"计量单位-内部数量到法定数量的换算"},{"level":2,"text":"损耗：从合理损耗到账册核减","id":"损耗-从合理损耗到账册核减"},{"level":2,"text":"对账机制与差异归因","id":"对账机制与差异归因"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"海关报文接口模型：数据交换格式、报文类型与回执机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-warehouse-ledger-integration/wms-customs-integration/customs-message-interface-and-receipt-model"},"next":{"title":"报文对账、重发与幂等：联网失败与数据不一致的处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-warehouse-ledger-integration/wms-customs-integration/message-reconciliation-retry-idempotency"}}